WEBVTT

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:26.080
<b>National Junior High 
Table Tennis Invitational</b>

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:39.890
Captain!

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:01.290
You're kidding me.

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:04.170
Oudou Academy... lost?

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:09.970
They're a powerhouse who've been national 
champions nine years running...

00:01:09.970 --> 00:01:11.130
And they lost?!

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:13.310
They got beaten in their first match!

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:16.510
But we're still in the group stage!

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:22.820
Captain, hold it together!

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:24.510
Impossible!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:28.610
Our captain would never 
lose in straight games!

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:30.270
This has to be a mistake!

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:33.450
We're the champions, you know?

00:01:33.450 --> 00:01:37.370
There's no way we'd lose to 
an unknown team like you.

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:42.530
D-Do you have a problem?

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:44.120
All I did was lay out some facts for you.

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:51.760
Thank you very much.

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:56.420
I hope we have another exciting, 
wonderful match someday.

00:02:09.180 --> 00:02:10.360
Captain...

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:19.000
Oudou Academy's era of dominance is over.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.890
It's our turn...

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:22.740
...to take the throne now.

00:02:56.800 --> 00:03:01.200
<b>Scorching</b>

00:02:56.800 --> 00:03:01.200
<b>Ping Pong Girls</b>

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:07.850
<b>First Serve</b>

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:07.850
<b>My Heart's About to Burst!</b>

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:10.640
Suzumegahara Municipal Junior High

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:14.140
How?

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:14.880
There!

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:15.560
One more time, please.

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:27.990
All right!

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:30.550
I-It's over.

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:32.750
Another win for Agari-senpai!

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:35.710
<b>Second-Year: Kamiya Agari</b>

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:38.250
Man, I lost again!

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:37.900
<b>Second-Year: Tenka Hanabi</b>

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:40.920
<b>Second-Year: Itsumo Hokuto</b>

00:04:39.530 --> 00:04:40.920
Don't worry about it.

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:44.560
I really am no match for you, Agari.

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:45.460
Hmph!

00:04:45.460 --> 00:04:48.390
Play another ten years before 
you even think of beating me.

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:53.810
<b>Third-Year: Munemune-senpai</b>

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:51.620
Seriously.

00:04:52.070 --> 00:04:53.810
You're so good.

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:56.810
No wonder you're the school's 
highest-ranked player.

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:56.810
<b>1. Kamiya Agari
2. Tenka Hanabi
3. Itsumo Hokuto
4. Munemune</b>

00:04:57.140 --> 00:04:59.800
You've even got someone from 
the school paper covering you.

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:02.590
You make me proud as a senior.

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:05.120
Th-Thank you.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:06.820
School's highest-ranked?

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:10.580
All of our team members have 
been ranked in order of ability.

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:16.060
<b>1. Kamiya Agari

00:05:12.030 --> 00:05:15.310
Does that mean Kamiya-san's better than you?

00:05:15.310 --> 00:05:16.060
Yeah.

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:20.590
The only thing Munemune-senpai has 
going for her is her soft rack.

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:22.790
Mean! There are plenty of 
other good things about me!

00:05:22.790 --> 00:05:25.260
But you're a worse player than Hokuto and me.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:27.690
Knock it off. You're being rude to Senpai.

00:05:27.690 --> 00:05:28.660
Id hurdz!

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:29.430
I ged id!

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:31.220
I-I'm showwy!

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:34.010
Wow, so Kamiya-san's pretty amazing.

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:36.660
Yeah, Agari-senpai is amazing!

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:38.400
As a second-year, she's already 
the best player in the school!

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:40.480
She's so good, she reached the 
quarterfinals in the city tournament!

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:42.820
She's our ace and our pride and joy!

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:43.740
Ace!

00:05:44.890 --> 00:05:45.940
Ace...

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:48.570
Could you play with me next?

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:50.080
And me after that?

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:50.780
Me, too!

00:05:51.210 --> 00:05:52.330
H-Hey...

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:53.900
Stop pulling me.

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:55.500
Wow, hot stuff.

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:04.850
<i>Everyone here praises me...</i>

00:06:04.850 --> 00:06:07.020
<i>They put me on a pedestal!</i>

00:06:07.020 --> 00:06:10.180
<i>I'm so, so, so happy!</i>

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:16.600
How are you all doing?

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:21.460
Agari-senpai!

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:22.190
<b>Team 
Ace!</b>

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:22.190
<b>City
Quarterfinalist!</b>

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:22.190
Play for us!

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:24.570
Here I go.

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:26.110
Stands!

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:30.860
Arena!

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:37.370
Agari! Agari!

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:40.480
Ace! Ace!

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:43.470
Agari! Agari!

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:43.470
<i>Being the ace is the greatest feeling.</i>

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:46.340
Ace! Ace...

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:46.340
<i>My heart's about to burst!</i>

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:48.630
<b>1. Kamiya Agari

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:52.330
<i>I'll never hand this spot over to anyone.</i>

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:57.590
Did you check out this month's 
<i>Table Tennis Square,</i> Agari?

00:06:57.590 --> 00:07:00.290
Believe it or not, in this year's 
National Junior High Invitational,

00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:02.790
Oudou Academy, the nine-time 
defending national champions,

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:05.320
were defeated by Hayabusa Academy, who 
were making their debut appearance!

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:07.280
Huh?

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:11.740
And Hayabusa rode that momentum to 
their first ever national title!

00:07:12.170 --> 00:07:14.550
They won the championship 
in their first appearance?

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:15.700
Wow!

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:21.000
Hmph! I couldn't care less about 
a tournament I didn't play in.

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:23.270
It's too bad.

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:26.340
Kiruka got ruled out of the qualifiers.

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:29.520
But we're going to Nationals this year.

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:32.810
We'll be the next team to make 
a splash on the national stage.

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:35.450
That's Agari-senpai for you!

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:36.720
She's so cool!

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:50.230
<i>Nationals...</i>

00:07:50.230 --> 00:07:51.660
<i>I so want to go.</i>

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:58.450
<i>I mean, my heart's about to burst 
just from being the best on the team.</i>

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:01.660
<i>If I go to Nationals, I bet</i>

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:06.290
<i>it'll feel even better.</i>

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:09.250
My heart's about to burst!

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:14.470
An intruder?!

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:15.130
Help me!

00:08:16.420 --> 00:08:20.190
U-Uh, I got up here, but I can't get down.

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:24.440
C-Could you please lend me a hand?

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:31.570
I'm Tsumujikaze Koyori.

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:35.840
I transferred into this 
school, and I start today.

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:38.680
Er, I tripped and fell in front of the gate,

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:42.700
and this thing rolled inside...

00:08:43.170 --> 00:08:46.660
I thought I could sneak 
in, grab it, and get out.

00:08:48.300 --> 00:08:49.850
I'm sorry!

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:52.690
Uh, I'm not sure why 
you're apologizing to me.

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:56.180
But why were you here so early, 
anyway? You're a transfer student.

00:08:59.190 --> 00:09:02.200
I got all excited about going to a new school

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:05.450
and ended up coming a bit early.

00:09:05.450 --> 00:09:08.170
A bit? It's not even seven yet.

00:09:08.170 --> 00:09:09.710
It's way too early.

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:15.990
Suzumegahara Municipal 
Junior High

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:13.590
Oh, you're here as early as ever.

00:09:17.130 --> 00:09:18.370
Good morning.

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:19.940
Yeah, good morning.

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:23.310
Um, and why are you here so early?

00:09:23.310 --> 00:09:26.000
Practice. I'm on the table tennis team.

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:30.050
Table tennis? You're on 
the table tennis team?!

00:09:30.050 --> 00:09:31.670
Y-Yeah. That's right.

00:09:32.660 --> 00:09:34.130
I... I...

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:37.620
I want to join the team, too.

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:39.810
Uh, I...

00:09:39.810 --> 00:09:42.100
I love table tennis!

00:09:49.260 --> 00:09:50.760
O-Oh, I'm sorry.

00:09:50.760 --> 00:09:52.880
I got too worked up.

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:55.480
Were you on the table tennis 
team at your previous school?

00:09:55.480 --> 00:09:56.630
Yes.

00:09:56.630 --> 00:09:59.890
Want to come take a look now, then?

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:06.190
Hey, at your previous school...

00:10:09.510 --> 00:10:10.900
Tsumujikaze-san!

00:10:11.550 --> 00:10:12.300
Yes?

00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:14.640
Want to get some casual hits in?

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:16.340
Can we?

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:18.890
Only casual, okay?

00:10:18.890 --> 00:10:20.760
And only until the rest show up.

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:22.290
Please.

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:23.160
That was quick!

00:10:27.510 --> 00:10:29.850
What year are you in?

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:31.190
Second.

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:33.180
Just like me, then.

00:10:33.180 --> 00:10:34.600
I'm a second-year, too.

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:37.870
I-Is that so, er...

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:40.570
Oh, I'm Kamiya Agari.

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:42.820
Kamiya-san... It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:46.000
No need to be so formal. We're the same age.

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:46.790
R-Right.

00:10:49.570 --> 00:10:51.610
Uh, Kamiya-san.

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:53.250
Thank you.

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:54.670
Huh?!

00:10:59.690 --> 00:11:01.760
Why are you thanking me?

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:05.600
For helping me out earlier.

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:11.150
I realized that I'd apologized, 
but I didn't thank you.

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:13.480
You didn't have to do it immediately.

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:14.980
S-Sorry!

00:11:16.850 --> 00:11:18.890
<i>She could actually return that?</i>

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:22.030
<i>How about this?</i>

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:24.620
<i>Not half-bad!</i>

00:11:34.490 --> 00:11:35.290
<i>Hey!</i>

00:11:36.910 --> 00:11:38.340
<i>I said casual!</i>

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:40.220
<i>This is almost like...</i>

00:11:42.390 --> 00:11:44.300
<i>Well, if it's a fight you want...</i>

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:54.150
Morning!

00:11:57.280 --> 00:11:58.920
Good morning!

00:11:58.920 --> 00:11:59.960
Good morning.

00:11:59.960 --> 00:12:01.320
Morning!

00:12:02.690 --> 00:12:04.820
<i>What was that feeling just now?</i>

00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:10.500
Huh? Who's that?

00:12:11.090 --> 00:12:12.830
I picked her up at the front gate.

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:14.960
You make it sound like she's a puppy.

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:19.810
I-I'm Tsumujikaze Koyori, a second-year.

00:12:19.810 --> 00:12:21.720
Nice to meet you.

00:12:24.620 --> 00:12:26.740
Nice to meetcha, Taily.

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:28.430
T-Taily?

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:31.700
After your two great pigtails.

00:12:31.700 --> 00:12:34.020
You may call me Hana-chan.

00:12:34.550 --> 00:12:36.730
And this is Hokuto.

00:12:37.850 --> 00:12:38.610
Pink?

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:42.440
I'm Munemune-senpai.

00:12:43.290 --> 00:12:44.150
Massive rack!

00:12:44.470 --> 00:12:46.370
Nice to meet you!

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:47.370
Rabid pack?!

00:12:49.570 --> 00:12:50.890
Wait, time out.

00:12:50.890 --> 00:12:52.830
You're scaring her, so back off.

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:56.040
You, don't play with the pigtails 
of a girl you've just met.

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:57.540
I'm showwy!

00:12:58.070 --> 00:13:00.780
And, Munemune-senpai, pack up your rack.

00:13:00.780 --> 00:13:02.330
Their size is scaring her.

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:04.500
Don't just casually ask for the impossible!

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:06.010
My breasts don't bite.

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:10.620
Sorry they're so rowdy, Tsumujikaze-san.

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:12.550
Don't be. Thank you.

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:15.220
You're so nice, Kamiya-san.

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:17.100
Not really.

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:18.960
This is nothing special.

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:20.810
She's blushing!

00:13:20.810 --> 00:13:22.440
I am not!

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:24.060
Anyway, let's start practice!

00:13:24.060 --> 00:13:26.300
But, Agari-chan, you have an interview...

00:13:28.840 --> 00:13:32.140
Go on. We'll take care of Tsumujikaze-san.

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:33.370
Thank you.

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:35.830
<b>Table Tennis Team Locker Room</b>

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:40.790
Well, we're doing a story on 
the most proficient members

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:42.810
of various teams and clubs.

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:48.400
You've played table tennis before, right?

00:13:48.400 --> 00:13:50.300
Yes, right! That's right!

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.700
Then, would you like to play with someone?

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:54.940
May I really, er...

00:13:54.940 --> 00:13:56.360
Boobyboob-senpai?

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:58.020
It's Munemune-senpai.

00:14:00.050 --> 00:14:01.710
So, who would you like to play with?

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:08.450
All of them!

00:14:09.130 --> 00:14:11.870
Our table tennis team is 
pretty strong, right?

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:16.040
We often win local tournaments, and we 
even reached the city quarterfinals.

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:16.910
But that's as far as we go.

00:14:17.450 --> 00:14:18.250
What?

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:22.330
We compete in the city 
tournament, but that's it.

00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:24.830
When you consider the level 
of competition nationwide,

00:14:24.830 --> 00:14:26.900
you couldn't call us strong at all.

00:14:26.900 --> 00:14:28.500
Is our team weak, then?

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:32.740
I don't think we're <i>weak,</i>

00:14:33.240 --> 00:14:37.030
but we lack an X factor that 
will help us be more successful.

00:14:37.900 --> 00:14:38.750
Yeah,

00:14:39.890 --> 00:14:40.940
an X factor...

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:43.320
Let's have a good game.

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:44.610
Yes, let's!

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:48.140
I wonder how good Taily is.

00:14:48.140 --> 00:14:49.420
That girl with the pink handle

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:53.530
stopped trembling as soon 
as she picked up her racket.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:55.240
Love-all.

00:14:57.680 --> 00:15:00.820
So, I'm guessing your goal 
is to make it to Nationals?

00:15:00.820 --> 00:15:02.210
Of course.

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:03.650
This year, for sure, I'll lead the team to...

00:15:08.710 --> 00:15:13.640
This year, for sure, I'll lead 
the team to Nationals as its ace.

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:24.400
Thank you.

00:15:26.390 --> 00:15:28.940
Next, please.

00:15:29.350 --> 00:15:30.360
R-Right.

00:15:30.870 --> 00:15:34.560
My next question is to you personally.

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:36.950
Why do you play table tennis?

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:38.670
Why?

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:41.490
Well, like what you play for,

00:15:41.490 --> 00:15:43.800
or what led you to pick up the game.

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:46.270
What led me...?

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:50.340
You're awesome, Agari-chan!

00:15:58.550 --> 00:15:59.450
Agari!

00:15:59.450 --> 00:16:01.600
Taily is crazy good!

00:16:02.840 --> 00:16:04.770
She may only be facing first-years,

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:06.940
but she's beaten ten straight.

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:11.320
Kamiya-san.

00:16:13.540 --> 00:16:15.700
Wow, Tsumujikaze-san.

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:19.370
You won't be an official member 
until we receive your form...

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:20.830
<b>Tsumujikaze Koyori</b>

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:24.170
But, given you beat Tanpopo-chan,

00:16:23.230 --> 00:16:25.290
<b>Tsumujikaze Koyori</b>

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:25.290
you'll slot in right here.

00:16:25.930 --> 00:16:28.810
Welcome to the table tennis 
team, Tsumujikaze-san.

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:30.260
Thank you!

00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:34.450
Glad to have you on our 
team, Tsumujikaze-senpai.

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:35.040
Senpai!

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:35.510
Senpai!

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:39.220
Er, uh, I'm glad to be here.

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:54.240
<b>Class 2-3</b>

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:54.240
We're in the same class, eh?

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:58.200
That means I can play with your 
pigtails anytime, anywhere.

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:00.610
Ubiquitous pigtails!

00:17:00.610 --> 00:17:02.150
P-Please stop, Tenka-san!

00:17:02.150 --> 00:17:04.040
I told you to call me "Hana-chan!"

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:06.960
No!

00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:11.780
This will be on the upcoming test, okay?

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:16.880
<i>I knew she wasn't half-bad,</i>

00:17:16.880 --> 00:17:19.240
<i>but beating ten straight that 
quickly is something else.</i>

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:23.430
<i>Though, well, she was only 
up against first-years.</i>

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:25.410
<i>Anyone decent could have pulled that off...</i>

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:28.800
<i>She's asleep?!</i>

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:32.760
<i>She did came to school early, 
but I wasn't expecting this.</i>

00:17:34.910 --> 00:17:35.890
Tsumujikaze-san!

00:17:35.890 --> 00:17:37.200
Y-Yes!

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:39.280
I love table tennis!

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:49.460
We'll have an all-court 
rally practice until five.

00:17:53.610 --> 00:17:56.860
You seem to really enjoy 
yourself in practice, Taily.

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:58.470
It even puts a smile on my face.

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:03.170
Well, I really am having fun.

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:05.930
I love table tennis.

00:18:11.930 --> 00:18:14.610
May we call you Koyori-senpai 
from now on?

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:16.670
Yeah.

00:18:17.140 --> 00:18:18.340
Yay!

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:19.550
Koyori-senpai!

00:18:19.550 --> 00:18:20.940
Koyori-senpai.

00:18:20.940 --> 00:18:22.340
Koyori-senpai!

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:24.700
Koyori-senpai.

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:28.090
<i>I know we don't get new members often,</i>

00:18:28.090 --> 00:18:30.160
<i>but they're giving her too much attention!</i>

00:18:30.160 --> 00:18:33.210
<i>I mean, their ace is right here.</i>

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:35.840
Help, Kamiya-san!

00:18:40.820 --> 00:18:43.390
Looks like we won't get 
any practicing done today.

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:46.240
How about it, Koyori-chan?

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:48.850
Would you like to play with me?

00:18:49.590 --> 00:18:51.020
Munemune-senpai...

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:53.650
She challenged Koyori-senpai!

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:55.570
<b>Itsumo Hokuto

00:18:57.950 --> 00:19:01.380
<i>Munemune-senpai is ranked fourth. She's good.</i>

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:04.170
<i>Facing her will be nothing 
like playing first-years.</i>

00:19:04.730 --> 00:19:06.070
Let's go.

00:19:06.070 --> 00:19:07.500
Love-all.

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:17.970
Munemune-senpai brought out the smash.

00:19:17.970 --> 00:19:20.430
That's the first time 
Koyori-senpai's lost a point.

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:25.910
<i>Despite her mellow demeanor, 
Munemune-senpai is an attacker</i>

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:28.240
<i>whose main weapon is her drives.</i>

00:19:28.240 --> 00:19:31.120
<i>Plus, her smashes are the best in the school.</i>

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:32.700
<i>See?</i>

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:34.610
<i>This is how good our team is.</i>

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:41.660
Munemune-senpai is building a lead.

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:44.030
Koyori-senpai can't stop her smashes.

00:19:52.770 --> 00:19:55.050
<i>Munemune-senpai is good.</i>

00:20:10.320 --> 00:20:11.750
She's starting to put pressure on her.

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:13.990
What do you mean?

00:20:13.990 --> 00:20:16.750
Munemune-senpai has great offensive power,

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:19.110
but her footwork is lacking 
due to her stocky build.

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:21.320
When an opponent alternates 
between attacking fore and back,

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:24.410
she can't use her smash because 
returning takes all she has.

00:20:24.840 --> 00:20:29.370
<i>She figured out her weakness so quickly?</i>

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:35.460
1-3!

00:20:43.370 --> 00:20:45.930
Let's keep going, Koyori-chan.

00:20:46.940 --> 00:20:47.930
Sure!

00:21:03.480 --> 00:21:05.150
Taily wins!

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:08.120
Thank you very much.

00:21:08.440 --> 00:21:10.540
Koyori-senpai won!

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:13.540
She beat the number four!

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.330
What?!

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:18.890
You really are good, Koyori-chan.

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:20.830
I heard from one of the teachers

00:21:20.830 --> 00:21:24.380
that you were a prefectural semifinalist 
at your previous school.

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:27.120
Prefectural semifinalist?!

00:21:27.120 --> 00:21:30.350
I knew she was no ordinary player, but 
I wasn't expecting her to be that good!

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:33.860
No wonder she blew Munemune-senpai away.

00:21:33.860 --> 00:21:34.480
Mean!

00:21:34.860 --> 00:21:36.100
<i>Semifinalist?</i>

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:39.230
<i>Even I've only got as far 
as the city quarterfinals.</i>

00:21:39.550 --> 00:21:43.730
Y'know, doesn't that make her 
better than Agari-senpai?

00:21:43.730 --> 00:21:45.030
You may be right.

00:21:45.030 --> 00:21:46.550
Could we have...

00:21:47.130 --> 00:21:48.950
...a new ace on our hands?

00:21:50.170 --> 00:21:51.410
W-Wait a sec—

00:21:51.740 --> 00:21:53.030
Koyori-senpai!

00:21:53.030 --> 00:21:53.960
Koyori-senpai!

00:21:53.960 --> 00:21:55.450
Ace! Our new ace!

00:21:55.450 --> 00:21:56.760
It's so reassuring to have you!

00:21:56.760 --> 00:21:58.170
O-Oh, please!

00:22:02.700 --> 00:22:03.820
Kamiya-san?

00:22:04.840 --> 00:22:06.490
<i>My spot...</i>

00:22:06.970 --> 00:22:08.650
<i>My position as ace is under threat!</i>

00:23:43.860 --> 00:24:00.000
Preview

00:23:44.650 --> 00:23:46.440
Crap. That's not good enough.

00:23:45.400 --> 00:23:47.510
Don't lose, Hokuto!

00:23:46.820 --> 00:23:48.070
R-Really?!

00:23:47.510 --> 00:23:49.610
Uh, don't ask me.

00:23:48.070 --> 00:23:50.570
Hanabi, I bought that.

00:23:50.260 --> 00:23:51.980
Thanks for the food!

00:23:51.230 --> 00:23:52.740
Stupid... Stupid!

00:23:52.740 --> 00:23:54.960
There's more where that came from, Taily!

00:23:53.950 --> 00:23:55.830
Wow, this is amazing.

00:23:55.830 --> 00:23:58.040
I've never seen speed like this before.
